WEBVTT

00:02.130 --> 00:03.930
Amir Gaul?

00:03.930 --> 00:08.730
Yes, that is the name of the spirit you have:
Amir Gaul.

00:09.200 --> 00:14.160
The only way to live is to keep on winning,
and then serve as a Zymotan soldier.

00:16.950 --> 00:19.240
It's no use; I can't do it!

00:23.180 --> 00:25.750
I have heard that valuable spirits like Amir Gaul

00:25.750 --> 00:27.850
choose a human on their own.

00:28.890 --> 00:31.630
I have come to get you, Princess Rebecca.

00:31.630 --> 00:33.530
Come, let us go now.

00:33.830 --> 00:41.570
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:41.570 --> 00:48.530
Towards a far, faraway place

01:01.890 --> 01:08.100
Blown by the wind, we walk on

01:08.100 --> 01:15.060
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:15.270 --> 01:21.580
Even if a time of loss should come

01:21.580 --> 01:28.710
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:31.150 --> 01:38.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:38.560 --> 01:44.530
Towards something we can't lose

01:44.530 --> 01:52.170
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:52.170 --> 01:59.050
Towards a far, faraway place

02:27.610 --> 02:29.410
Let go of my hand.

02:29.940 --> 02:32.910
I believe I said that I have come to get you.

02:54.770 --> 02:56.790
I haven't seen you before.

02:58.740 --> 03:01.710
Oh, you can use spirits, can you?

03:02.780 --> 03:04.570
Draw it out.

03:04.910 --> 03:06.710
Amir Gaul...

03:11.590 --> 03:12.950
It won't come!

03:12.950 --> 03:15.150
I grow weary of this.

03:16.760 --> 03:18.560
Princess Rebecca!

03:22.330 --> 03:23.030
Princess Rebecca!

03:23.030 --> 03:24.330
Princess Rebecca!
Princess Rebecca!

03:24.700 --> 03:27.170
And so you escape with your life, boy.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.550
Princess Rebecca!

03:38.550 --> 03:40.580
What happened here?!

03:40.580 --> 03:44.880
Episode 11
A Looming Conspiracy

03:40.580 --> 03:42.250


Blast!

03:46.990 --> 03:51.080
Sorry, some bastard called Hugh
took off with her.

03:53.060 --> 03:56.190
So, this is what comes of fussing
over the likes of you?

03:57.570 --> 03:58.570
We're heading back!

03:58.570 --> 04:02.070
We need to assemble a force at once
to get Princess Rebecca back!

04:02.070 --> 04:03.570
Sir!

04:03.570 --> 04:04.610
Elda?

04:04.610 --> 04:06.840
Would you go to the northern fortress?

04:06.840 --> 04:09.140
But Princess Rebecca is...

04:09.140 --> 04:12.340
Our top priority is to strengthen our forces.

04:12.850 --> 04:15.010
You are the only one I can count on for that.

04:16.780 --> 04:18.580
Very well.

04:19.190 --> 04:23.120
As soon as we have amassed our forces,
we will move to recover Princess Rebecca.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.590
Make haste!

04:24.590 --> 04:26.220
Right.

04:27.530 --> 04:29.530
Damn it...

04:29.530 --> 04:31.830
How could I be so powerless?

04:36.870 --> 04:38.840
Is it frustrating?

04:40.580 --> 04:44.180
Yeah, it's too damn frustrating.

04:44.180 --> 04:46.650
Then, come with me.

05:03.000 --> 05:05.700
What do you think you're doing?

05:05.700 --> 05:08.140
If the outfit is not to your liking,

05:08.140 --> 05:10.540
I shall have something else brought for you.

05:10.540 --> 05:12.970
I am not your doll!

05:12.970 --> 05:14.980
Don't be so upset.

05:14.980 --> 05:18.750
I want you to keep an appearance
befitting your rank.

05:18.750 --> 05:20.010
That's all.

05:20.010 --> 05:24.450
You kill my father, toy around with me,
take away all that I have, and now this?

05:24.450 --> 05:25.550
What is the meaning of it?!

05:25.550 --> 05:32.230
Your father, the former king, was indeed
the most powerful shard caster.

05:32.230 --> 05:36.390
He was a man of valor with a heart of ice, who
never displayed any sort of weakness to anyone.

05:37.270 --> 05:40.500
However, he did have but one weakness:

05:40.500 --> 05:43.630
It was you.

05:52.380 --> 05:54.250
What is it Rebecca?

05:54.250 --> 05:56.220
Is there something you need?

06:09.800 --> 06:11.920
Re..Rebecca?

06:16.600 --> 06:18.170
Hugh!

06:18.170 --> 06:21.580
So, it was you after all?

06:21.580 --> 06:23.870
This is what you want, isn't it?

06:25.450 --> 06:28.540
Protect Rebecca for me...

06:30.350 --> 06:31.980
No!

06:52.070 --> 06:54.200
He's sealed it in her, has he?

06:55.910 --> 07:00.750
You used a maneuver shard to control my mind!

07:00.750 --> 07:02.720
And?

07:02.720 --> 07:04.520
And is that why you hate me?

07:04.520 --> 07:07.190
If you're going to hate someone...

07:07.190 --> 07:10.730
...hate yourself for being so weak
as to trust me enough

07:10.730 --> 07:17.190
that I could use even a
maneuver shard on you.

07:18.670 --> 07:23.240
Yes, both my father and I were
fools to have trusted you.

07:23.240 --> 07:26.300
But I will not let you get away with any
more than you already have!

07:27.180 --> 07:28.610
Oh?

07:28.610 --> 07:33.570
All you're after is the spirit that's
sealed within me!

07:33.950 --> 07:36.920
If I die, then that spirit will vanish too!

07:49.730 --> 07:52.890
The spirit tries to honor its
master's last request, eh?

07:58.540 --> 08:03.000
What a pitiful woman, unable
even to end her own life.

08:08.850 --> 08:11.150
Did you find what you were searching for?

08:12.550 --> 08:15.960
I mean the spirit shard that the old king had.

08:15.960 --> 08:18.430
You didn't think I was unaware of that, did you?

08:19.190 --> 08:22.320
It has been sealed inside Rebecca's body.

08:23.300 --> 08:27.070
Oh yeah? Then maybe I should help myself to it?

08:27.070 --> 08:30.040
It's a stubborn spirit, you see.

08:30.040 --> 08:34.080
There's the concern that it might be destroyed
if one were to try taking it from her by force.

08:34.080 --> 08:37.910
So, we can't do anything to the girl or her spirit?

08:37.910 --> 08:40.040
Well, I do have a plan.

08:42.280 --> 08:44.120
Shall I help you?

08:44.120 --> 08:46.420
I'll ask when the time comes.

08:47.790 --> 08:49.090
Liar.

08:49.090 --> 08:51.560
I won't let you have it to yourself.

09:08.110 --> 09:10.910
Zed, where are you?

09:20.020 --> 09:22.490
Hey, how far are we going?

09:33.970 --> 09:36.600
Is this the northern fortress?

10:00.830 --> 10:02.800
There's no one here!

10:11.640 --> 10:15.100
Hey! Is this really the northern fortress or what?!

10:16.580 --> 10:18.200
Run!

10:55.550 --> 10:57.120
How are you feeling?

10:57.120 --> 10:58.250
Kill me.

10:58.250 --> 11:01.390
Right here, right now!

11:01.390 --> 11:03.320
I can't do that,

11:03.320 --> 11:06.950
because I have need of your power.

11:07.560 --> 11:10.560
Not me, but the spirit, right?

11:10.560 --> 11:12.400
Well, of course.

11:12.400 --> 11:15.500
But your own powers are also essential

11:15.500 --> 11:18.840
for Zymot's continued prosperity, Rebecca.

11:18.840 --> 11:21.970
You think I could believe that shameless
lie now, you traitor?

11:22.780 --> 11:26.150
Your father was heartless and level-headed,

11:26.150 --> 11:29.950
and he was the strongest of shard casters.

11:30.690 --> 11:35.290
If you're a citizen of Zymot,
you must know that as well.

11:35.290 --> 11:39.920
I have merely surpassed your father,
King Bakkam. That's all this is.

11:43.200 --> 11:48.000
The current regime and rebel forces are
divided now, but were originally one.

11:48.800 --> 11:51.870
Both must have the same love for Zymot.

11:51.870 --> 11:54.140
Am I wrong?

11:54.140 --> 11:57.110
Shouldn't they be reunited?

12:03.850 --> 12:06.150
Want to get married, Rebecca?

12:13.090 --> 12:14.600
Go! After 'em!

12:14.600 --> 12:16.390
Don't let them get away!

12:19.730 --> 12:21.470
They're a persistent bunch.

12:21.470 --> 12:23.440
Now then, shall we be off?

12:27.240 --> 12:29.580
Well, they've got us now.

12:29.580 --> 12:31.250
Shall we give up?

12:31.250 --> 12:34.180
Huh? You're kidding!

12:34.180 --> 12:36.620
Besides, I'm tired of running around
trying to evade them.

12:36.620 --> 12:38.240
What?!

12:42.260 --> 12:45.160
Captain! It's Princess Rebecca!

12:45.160 --> 12:46.790
What?

12:50.630 --> 12:52.430
Princess Rebecca!

12:53.000 --> 12:54.270
Are you alone?

12:54.270 --> 12:56.240
I'm glad you're all right.

12:57.070 --> 12:59.540
I'm sorry I had you all worried.

12:59.540 --> 13:00.610
Not at all.

13:00.610 --> 13:04.310
We were just getting ready to
launch a rescue operation.

13:04.310 --> 13:06.250
I see...

13:06.250 --> 13:09.620
Elda and Zed don't seem to be around.

13:09.620 --> 13:14.220
They went off to the northern fortress
to get reinforcements.

13:14.220 --> 13:15.560
Oh...

13:15.560 --> 13:17.420
Please, come inside.

13:17.420 --> 13:19.550
Everyone's been awaiting your return.

13:21.800 --> 13:23.420
Right...

13:25.470 --> 13:26.800
What?!

13:26.800 --> 13:28.740
You sent her back?!

13:28.740 --> 13:30.940
After we finally recaptured her?

13:30.940 --> 13:33.410
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

13:36.280 --> 13:38.280
Where are you going?

13:38.280 --> 13:42.380
To go get the woman back, naturally!

13:42.380 --> 13:45.020
Rebecca will be back...

13:45.020 --> 13:46.290
...without fail.

13:46.290 --> 13:48.760
There's no way she'll come back!

13:50.590 --> 13:55.720
I can't stand waiting any longer...

13:57.460 --> 13:59.230
Give me the reward you promised!

13:59.230 --> 14:01.640
Right now!

14:01.640 --> 14:04.840
What's gotten into you, Dumas?
This isn't like you at all.

14:04.840 --> 14:07.310
Is it really so hard for you to trust me?

14:15.750 --> 14:17.820
Sorry, Hugh.

14:17.820 --> 14:19.790
Get yourself some rest.

14:19.790 --> 14:22.820
You'll be very busy before long.

14:22.820 --> 14:26.280
R..Right, I think I'll do just that.

14:32.300 --> 14:34.470
A marriage between Princess
Rebecca and Hugh?

14:34.470 --> 14:35.970
I'll never accept such a thing!

14:35.970 --> 14:37.400
It's clearly a trap!

14:37.400 --> 14:41.010
But it's also the perfect chance
to get close to Hugh.

14:41.010 --> 14:42.540
We could take him out!

14:42.540 --> 14:45.550
But if this marriage turns out to be for real,

14:45.550 --> 14:48.950
it will mean the birth of a new
monarchy in Zymot.

14:48.950 --> 14:51.990
That means we needn't give our lives in vain!

14:51.990 --> 14:53.250
You're too naive.

14:53.250 --> 14:55.020
This is Hugh we're dealing with!

14:55.020 --> 14:58.230
Why did he release the Princess?

14:58.230 --> 15:01.400
Could there be something
else he has his eye on?

15:01.400 --> 15:02.760
You don't think...

15:02.760 --> 15:04.830
...it was to find this hideout?

15:04.830 --> 15:10.040
If that's the case, then he may already
have troops on the way.

15:10.040 --> 15:14.510
That's exactly why we should
accept this marriage!

15:14.510 --> 15:17.380
Calm yourselves! You're in the presence
of Princess Rebecca.

15:17.380 --> 15:20.050
Our lives are on the line here!

15:20.050 --> 15:22.020
You think we can be calm now?

15:22.020 --> 15:25.050
In any case, I'm not for dying in vain.

15:25.050 --> 15:27.520
Let's surrender and take a step
towards a new era of peace.

15:27.520 --> 15:31.150
No, we should hide in the wilds
and await our opportunity.

15:33.490 --> 15:34.630
Where are you going?

15:34.630 --> 15:36.460
I leave this to all of you.

15:36.460 --> 15:39.430
Call me when you've reached a decision.

15:51.350 --> 15:53.140
Princess Rebecca...

15:55.020 --> 15:57.810
Phillip, what would you do?

15:59.190 --> 16:01.590
Given the present situation,

16:01.590 --> 16:04.560
I'd say the best plan is to accept Hugh's terms.

16:05.830 --> 16:08.500
So, you're like the others?

16:08.500 --> 16:10.620
You would have me marry him?

16:13.970 --> 16:16.600
That's your answer, isn't it?

16:21.340 --> 16:22.810
I see...

16:22.810 --> 16:25.750
By the way, what happened to Elda and Zed?

16:25.750 --> 16:27.510
Aren't they back yet?

16:27.510 --> 16:29.640
Well, actually...

16:32.450 --> 16:34.690
That's Elda's!

16:34.690 --> 16:35.690
Yes...

16:35.690 --> 16:38.630
I am told that the northern fortress
was supposedly wiped out

16:38.630 --> 16:40.590
in an attack by the current regime.

16:41.200 --> 16:43.660
Then, Elda and Zed were...

16:45.130 --> 16:47.260
I'm sorry to say it, but most likely.

16:49.270 --> 16:51.400
N..No...

16:54.640 --> 16:57.480
Leave me alone for a bit.

16:57.480 --> 16:59.280
Very well...

17:12.930 --> 17:14.550
Elda!

17:17.100 --> 17:19.070
Are you okay, Elda?!

17:20.800 --> 17:22.800
Forget about me.

17:22.800 --> 17:25.640
Take care of Princess Rebecca!

17:25.640 --> 17:27.770
I can't leave you here like this!

17:31.950 --> 17:34.570
Damn, she'll be frozen solid.

17:39.790 --> 17:41.590
You're wasting your time.

17:41.590 --> 17:43.990
Go to Princess Rebecca!

17:43.990 --> 17:46.120
Enough of that, just keep quiet!

17:53.800 --> 17:55.600
Damn it...

18:08.020 --> 18:11.310
Let's go to Hugh.

18:40.650 --> 18:43.950
We're like a couple of ornamental
animal head mounts.

18:43.950 --> 18:44.950
Don't you think?

18:44.950 --> 18:49.080
You come all the way from Templar,
and this is how you end up?

18:55.500 --> 18:57.100
Mr. Dumas!

18:57.100 --> 18:59.170
I've been waiting for you, Dumas.

18:59.170 --> 19:00.700
You're looking well.

19:00.700 --> 19:05.370
Ah, it sounds like you're trying to say
you let them capture you.

19:05.370 --> 19:07.670
And what if I did?

19:10.380 --> 19:12.680
Watch that smart little mouth of yours!

19:12.680 --> 19:15.810
I can have you executed here!

19:16.520 --> 19:19.150
You're, um, a little close.

19:21.050 --> 19:24.160
But I can't kill you right away.

19:24.160 --> 19:28.200
I'm going to let you witness the
moment of my rebirth,

19:28.200 --> 19:32.370
when I will be freed from the
oppression of my past.

19:32.370 --> 19:36.340
There we go! Now it ends!

19:36.340 --> 19:41.480
This cursed mark and the fate I've
dealt with for so long...

19:41.480 --> 19:44.270
It shall all come to an end!

19:47.580 --> 19:48.820
Why...

19:48.820 --> 19:50.780
Pathetic, isn't it?

20:02.860 --> 20:04.800
She's in trouble if I don't hurry.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.600
I'm counting on you.

20:33.130 --> 20:34.750
Elda!

20:36.030 --> 20:38.000
Pull it together. Hey!

20:51.480 --> 20:54.080
I am alone.

20:54.080 --> 20:57.880
If I can just endure this, that's enough.

21:14.970 --> 21:18.170
Why did you save me?

21:18.170 --> 21:22.140
I just paid you back what I owed you, that's all.

21:22.140 --> 21:24.270
I've got to pay back Rebecca too!

21:27.110 --> 21:29.080
Do you want power?

21:32.750 --> 21:34.550
Come with me!

21:56.080 --> 21:58.540
Returned just as I thought you would, eh?

22:00.280 --> 22:03.080
I should expect no less of the
daughter of the former king.

22:03.080 --> 22:05.050
It was a wise choice.

22:07.290 --> 22:11.090
Well, then, allow me to introduce
your dear bridegroom.

22:13.360 --> 22:14.990
Introduce?

22:15.760 --> 22:17.890
You are to be married...

22:20.530 --> 22:22.500
...to Dumas Schkramux.

22:23.440 --> 22:27.900
I am ever so delighted to meet you,
Princess Rebecca.

22:50.400 --> 22:54.270
I want to peak inside your heart, and find
out your feelings and expressions

22:54.270 --> 22:58.170
I see you bearing your burden alone, and don't
ask the reason for your twinkling tears

22:58.170 --> 23:01.740
I give you a shout of support without mentioning
them, between the answers I'm looking for

23:01.740 --> 23:05.870
Without obsessing or over thinking,
I feel sunbeams in the future you

23:07.580 --> 23:09.420
It feels nice, very, very much

23:09.420 --> 23:11.220
You and me, we're very, very good

23:11.220 --> 23:15.090
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:15.090 --> 23:16.920
Very, very much, whenever

23:16.920 --> 23:18.760
Very, very good, not changing

23:18.760 --> 23:24.720
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

23:30.240 --> 23:32.710
I feel this kindness amidst my doubt

23:34.010 --> 23:36.480
I will always have faith in you at all times

23:37.740 --> 23:41.650
Here in this vast landscape
under the sunny blue sky

23:41.650 --> 23:45.780
We got good feelings, good social standing,
we're good; I want to always be here

23:47.250 --> 23:49.060
It feels nice, very, very much

23:49.060 --> 23:50.890
You and me, we're very, very good

23:50.890 --> 23:54.690
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:54.690 --> 23:56.560
Very, very much, whenever

23:56.560 --> 23:58.430
Very, very good, not changing

23:58.430 --> 24:04.390
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

24:16.750 --> 24:19.950
Next time, "Progress Towards the Truth"

24:17.020 --> 24:19.950
Next Time
Progress Towards the Truth
